      "id": "DIAL_Z03.DDX#0",
      "node_id": 300026,
      "source": "\tMist floated in the pass.\n\t\"This road leads to Krondor and the west,\" @4 said, \"though I believe it also forks to the north and leads through the Dimwood forest. Which way do you think would be best?\"\u0000",
