    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z03.DDX#1",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tThe trip was ódull.\n\tWith only the occasional cold draft to chill their bones as they moved through the pass, it was a relief to finally feel the more temperate winds typical to the southern coastal reaches of the Kingdom...\u0000",
