    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z03.DDX#31",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tSince we've come this far north, Gorath, I want to go on up to Cavall Keep.\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "",
      "status": "untranslated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z03.DDX#32",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tPrince Arutha seemed to think that finding this Pug was of importance...\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "",
      "status": "untranslated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z03.DDX#33",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tIt óis important, but at the same time, we aren't far from there and I need to find out if Ugyne and my uncle are all right.\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\xf3",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "",
      "status": "untranslated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z03.DDX#34",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tWhy would they not be?\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "",
      "status": "untranslated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z03.DDX#35",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tWe were captured by moredhel who had penetrated into the Kingdom as far south as Cavall Keep. Since they took us, how can I be certain they didn't ride into Cavall Keep and burn it all to the ground? Maybe Navon du Sandau's Nighthawk friends didn't appreciate their little ring being broken up and decided to take it out on the local count. I've been thinking about it since we escaped from Sar-Sargoth and it's something I just need to know...\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "",
      "status": "untranslated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "DIAL_Z03.DDX#36",
      "node_id": null,
      "source": "\tI don't wish to sound indifferent to the fate of your kin, but I think there are rather more important issues to concentrate on. If the Kingdom falls to Delekhan and his supporters, I can óguarantee your relatives will find their deaths early. I will go wherever you lead, Owyn, but I think you should think with your head rather than your heart...\u0000",
      "tokens": [
        "\\x09",
        "\\xf3",
        "\\x00"
      ],
      "translation": "",
      "status": "untranslated",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
