      "node_id": 300029,
      "source": "\tThe acolyte stopped.\n\t\"I... do not fully understand,\" he started. \"A disturbance surrounding Malac's Cross precludes any teleporting there. I am sorry, but from óthis end there is nothing óI can do.\"\u0000",
